# Project-specific — docs/ stays private (drafts, roadmap, posts), except the
# assets the public README points at. Git cannot re-include a path under an
# excluded directory, so the directory itself must not be excluded outright.
docs/*
!docs/assets/
.superpowers/
.omc/
vibe/

